/* English (development language) strings for text built in code with `localized(_:)`.
   The key is the English text itself, with %@ for strings and %lld for integers; the value
   repeats it. To add a language, copy this file and Localizable.stringsdict into <language>.lproj
   and translate the values (and the plural forms). Counted phrases live in Localizable.stringsdict.
   Text written as SwiftUI literals (Text("…"), Button("…")) uses the same key rule and falls
   back to the literal when it has no entry, so only strings built in code are listed here. */

